Audit b0020ed (界面验收部):
- HIGH: 回小岛 called requestExit synchronously, while the chest / region claims fired by the same tap were still
  queued in the host's microtask claim batch; the session was gone by the time they ran, so they were rejected and
  the rewards lost. The host now hands the board an afterClaims hook; 回小岛 runs inside the same batch, after the
  claims (each awaited), then exits. 下一关 already went through the batch.
- MEDIUM: watchClaims no longer opens RewardPanel while the result screen is up (the badges on the panel show the
  rewards). It still opens elsewhere, e.g. opening a chest from the bag.
- test_result_home_claims: real board + real enqueueResultBatch; asserts claim writes then exit, save/inventory
  persisted, and no RewardPanel across 5 chest taps. test_result_safe_area updated to expect no RewardPanel.
